&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6R_RWDPuyYQQ7kNvwGeGHpL&_nc_oc=Adqielz3MmsdLqV-ApzdNYMoP5-fDKdQdea406ktxe_66LyapvK-Fsmk5VhYJ0iY74w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0qWWuhVJacsvG6nm0pUD5b7Tsha_LV4P4q186qyvSi1g&oe=69F1FCE4"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT 5.png", "id": "871186708617520", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_871186711950853_2916978727201656771_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HiSQDMRzzhgQ7kNvwGln02M&_nc_oc=AdpOTM5crC0CDQiKbjgdJ-k0cIHrdzFgrlkqyQlEz4ORbSSk5GuvMszrrAEdi7ZFV4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3FAKxihFnRw99MM6ZB2I09MeeLpglocMgSioWYejHUyw&oe=69F20264"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Captain Cat", "keywords": ["cozy", "cosy", "relaxing", "cat", "vr"], "long_description": "# What if a cat\u2019s 9th life doesn\u2019t end in nothingness? What if, instead, it leads to a tropical archipelago?\n\nIn Captain Cat, the afterlife is a sunlit chain of islands, each home to a different cat with their own quirks, quests, and challenges. Pick fruit, go fishing, upgrade your boat, and explore at your own pace. Meet a whole cast of feline locals who need your help\u2014and discover the secrets of this purrfect paradise.\n{685082091144864}\n\n**Features:\nA cozy, tropical cat-afterlife to explore\nIsland-by-island quests and charming characters\nFishing, fruit picking, and boat upgrades\nRelaxed progression with plenty of discoveries**\n\nEarly Access coming December 2025", "short_description": "What if a cat\u2019s 9th life leads to a tropical archipelago? In Captain Cat, the afterlife is a sunlit chain of islands filled with feline neighbors, quests, and gentle challenges. Purrfect for a cozy and relaxing time.\nFish, pick fruit, upgrade your boat, and help cats across the afterlife as you uncover its playful secrets."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/captai